 national data dominance strategy - what it's been &amp; where they're going next:\nhttps://t.co/FA6IhCIAzu https://t.co/MNa6rxVxcM https://t.co/RH7GqU1Yn0", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2113648161533132953"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:05:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113647998773182478"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/desmondshum/st…", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/desmondshum/status/2113639609938690237", "start": 257, "url": "https://t.co/bxAgZuBwVY"}]}, "id": "2113647998773182478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 8205, "like_count": 70, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 15}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113639609938690237", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "“To me, this is much more than another tax crackdown. It illustrates a fundamental truth about wealth in China: no matter how much you accumulate, how carefully you structure it, or how far into the future you plan, no wealth is truly safe under CCP rule.” https://t.co/bxAgZuBwVY", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2113647998773182478"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113646645262925824"]}, "author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:00:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113646768873161043"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 70, "id": "18701421", "start": 59, "username": "tysonbrody"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/UjMnloI3cF", "end": 271, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113646768873161043/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113646645262925824", "start": 248, "url": "https://t.co/UjMnloI3cF"}, {"display_url": "x.com/jstein_sun/sta…", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jstein_sun/status/2113626346467332264", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/voKbZ4RpY5"}]}, "id": "2113646768873161043", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 31259, "like_count": 210, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113626346467332264", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Learned some interesting details in this POLITICO story on @tysonbrody. But also I thought it missed a few important details, such as the fact that if you invite him over to your house, he will bring you a gigantic box of pandan-flavorted pastries https://t.co/UjMnloI3cF https://t.co/voKbZ4RpY5", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113646768873161043"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113644016776392706"]}, "author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:52:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113644769981108304"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 51, "id": "258157507", "start": 37, "username": "jeannasmialek"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/XWpYanuKGa", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113644769981108304/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113644016776392706", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/XWpYanuKGa"}, {"display_url": "x.com/tracyalloway/s…", "end": 322, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/tracyalloway/status/2113632538157789391", "start": 299, "url": "https://t.co/WVmSW1apCE"}]}, "id": "2113644769981108304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 11877, "like_count": 49, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113632538157789391", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "It was so wonderful catching up with @jeannasmialek, who we hardly ever see anymore since she left the Fed beat and decamped to Europe.\n\nDuring our conversation, I suddenly remembered that in 2002, Russell Roberts (host of the EconTalk podcast) also wrote a a romance novel. https://t.co/XWpYanuKGa https://t.co/WVmSW1apCE", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2113644769981108304"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:47:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113643514395250867"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/caixin/status/…", "end": 57, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.